# The CI pins, one NAME=value per line: the workflows append these lines to GITHUB_ENV, scripts/ci reads them.
# PlatformIO Core, the pioarduino platform-espressif32 release platformio.ini installs, the sha256 of the
# partitions.bin that partitions.csv builds (a partitions.csv change updates it).
PIO_VERSION=6.1.19
PIO_PLATFORM=55.03.38-1
PARTITIONS_SHA256=f4d0da804f176436c08e7e5c1631a48eb6e0bcc4a71ce9a6e41485bb76e38ed6
